  "notes": "Take-off, stay low at 1,000 feet. Descend to 500 feet above water, then flyover Monas at 300 feet, left of the Monas. Fly straight for a few seconds, then start a left 270 degrees turn and climb to 800 feet. Align with Monas again and go from Delta to the missing man formation (5 seconds before reaching Monas). Fly straight, then perform a half cuban eight and dive to 300', 400 knots, while missing man rejoins. Low flyover over Jalan Gulunggung, followed by a right turn to overfly the runway. Perform 270 degrees right turn to align with runway and either land with overhead break or extend.",
